# Site icons and renders are binary — autocrlf must never rewrite them.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# ⚠ THE REQUIREMENT-SCOPE CONTRACT IS HASH-PINNED across three repos, and the
# pin is computed from the WORKING FILE. Without a fixed line ending a Windows
# checkout gets CRLF, the sha256 changes, and every drift gate fails on a fresh
# clone - a false "someone edited it" that the obvious fix (bump the hash)
# would launder into a real split.
requirement-scope.js text eol=lf
